      "message": "My only concern is that when I ran this command I initially missed the note about needing to download the tgz file and move it to /var/cache/distfiles. It\u0027s not critical but it might be worth including that note (pasted below) or at least a summary.\n\nFetch instructions for dev-embedded/jlink-6.94a:\n * Segger requires you to accept their license agreement before downloading.\n * Download https://www.segger.com/downloads/jlink/JLink_Linux_V694a_x86_64.tgz\n * with your browser and place it in DISTDIR (usually /var/cache/distfiles/)\n * Running stacked hooks for post_pkg_nofetch\n *    distdir ...\n * On Chromium OS, DISTDIR is /var/cache/distfiles/ inside the chroot\n * and ~/chromiumos/.cache/distfiles/ outside the chroot.",
